        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes by catching fruits each level everything is faster and different, how far can you reach? but be careful of the bombs!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Catch, Dodge, and Multiply!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a snowy world full of action and charm in this addictive 2D catch game. Star as an adorable kawaii penguin, glide through wintry landscapes of snow-capped mountains and a frozen lake, and collect falling fruits while dodging sneaky bombs and chasing bonus lightnings that boost your score. How far can you go before speed and chaos overwhelm you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172370/extras/dad27d1265f6cb06253ddbeeaf7fd0ed.poster.avif?t=1769579652\" width=1170 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172370/extras/dad27d1265f6cb06253ddbeeaf7fd0ed.webm?t=1769579652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Classic Mode:</strong> Each level increases speed and fruit count—sharpen your reflexes and push your limits!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk &amp; Reward:</strong> Starting at level 3, bombs appear to end your run—but bonus lightnings grant temporary bomb immunity and score multipliers (x2, x3, x4… and beyond!).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kawaii Customization:</strong> Unlock and choose from a variety of cute skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Level Editor:</strong> Design your own challenges with ease, save them to the cloud, and share them with the community. Play levels created by other players from around the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Winter Atmosphere:</strong> Backgrounds subtly shift hues with each level, accompanied by relaxing festive music and cheerful visual effects that celebrate every win.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172370/extras/e7bce2aaee9ed8835b15c61a0ca363e2.avif?t=1769579652\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARE YOU MORE THAN JUST A FRUIT CATCHER?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your creativity in the Level Editor, where every fruit, bomb, and bonus is under your control. Share your creations to the cloud and challenge friends or global players to conquer your custom levels. Can they survive your traps and surprises?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172370/extras/1c8fe417cc79981abaf8521dbaac03fc.poster.avif?t=1769579652\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172370/extras/1c8fe417cc79981abaf8521dbaac03fc.webm?t=1769579652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172370/extras/1c8fe417cc79981abaf8521dbaac03fc.mp4?t=1769579652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to become the king of the frozen lake?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
